"""The site's one family of drawn marks. Every tile that holds a mark (a figure, a step, a stat, a
category) takes its mark from here, so they all share a 64 box, flat filled shapes, the brand's six
colours and 2.6 ink lines. The seven content kinds were drawn first for the bag (glyphs_bag.json);
the rest are drawn to sit beside them.

Small marks inside buttons, links and meta lines are not these: they are the stroke set in the
page's sprite (svg.ic, 1.75 line). Marks engraved inside a seal are stroke too, in one colour."""
